{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1282417-the-properties-of-ley-lines-and-ley-energy","id":1282417,"title":"The properties of ley lines and ley energy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-24T05:48:33-08:00","id":1282417,"title":"The properties of ley lines and ley energy","content":"One of my players is very interested in studying ley lines and ley energy. Before I give this to the player I'd appreciate a second opinion:<br /> <br /> <br /> Ley energy is attracted and repelled by material/technological complexity, complex well-formed geometrical shapes (especially High Speech runes), intense forces, things with history, and sheer biomass. It seeks balanced exposure with increasing intensity. Meaning that it will flow towards a raging bonfire, but after exposure will be repelled by examples of Forces less or as intense until it has been exposed to Time, Matter, Space, and Life of similar intensity. Particularly intense Forces such as forest fires, hurricanes, or power stations will still attract it. <br /> <br /> Subtle Arcana cause waves and ripples that become Resonance (variations on the gross Arcana of the most intense exposure, no subtle resonance, Ley energy is about physicality). <br /> <br /> Ley energy of the same resonance flows with smooth speed, little to no viscosity. Ley energy of different resonances clump and slow as the two resonances combine and interact until one dominates. <br /> <br /> This is how leylines form, as the ley energy flows along the path of least resistance towards its next attraction point. Nodes occur when leylines intersect and clump around a mutual attraction point. Otherwise the leylines flow over/under eachother like oil and water<br /> <br /> Ley energy comes from the stars, the sun, and volcanoes<br /> <br /> Ley energy mediates the interaction of the Gross Arcana (Space, Time, Matter, Life, Forces) in the fallen world. <br /> <br /> This is not to say that in its complete absence it they will cease to interact, but rather that such interactions become wild and erratic: a candlestick might burn halfway through in a blink of an eye, only to have the flame go still and nonreactive for the half hour that would normally take, and then abruptly spread to a nearby tablecloth. <br /> <br /> Ley energy is the Fallen mirror of the Supernal semantic for the Practice of Perfecting. It enhances (+2 dice) its Resonance quality, even if that quality is \u201cFrailty\u201d, &quot;Disease, or \u201cOld Age\u201d<br /> <br /> Ley energy that respires into the human body falls under the influence of their ephmeral soul. The resulting constantly changing resonances cause it to thicken and become unable to leave the body. The chackras and meridians in certain forms of Eastern mysticism are an attempt to describe the resulting ponderous flows and vortices within the body. <br /> <br /> Ley energy that has been fully processed to resonate perfecly with the physicality of the body and soul seeps into the sympathetic link between the two. It Perfects the link between body and soul, congealing into the metaphysical space between the two as a bridge and anchor between them. This helps mediate the communication between the ephmeral soul (mind/fate/death/spirit/prime) and the physicality of the body, though it is not the only mechanism by which that occurs. <br /> <br /> The hold this anchor has upon the soul is what Death mages fray when they steal a soul.<br /> <br /> Awakened Gnosis entangles itself with this anchor, enlightening it from a Fallen reflection of Prime to a true Supernal Mystery. <br /> <br /> The imprint of the soul left on this anchor, and the entangling of Awakened Gnosis with it, are why personality and spellcasting remain for a time even after soul loss.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3642-lareath","name":"Lareath","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"186"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-24T10:26:37-08:00","id":1282453,"title":"","content":"Not sure it would fly in every game, it kind of has a lot of fiddly bits, but I don't see it causing any problems.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-25T01:38:55-08:00","id":1282600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1282417-the-properties-of-ley-lines-and-ley-energy?p=1282453#post1282453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not sure it would fly in every game, it kind of has a lot of fiddly bits, but I don't see it causing any problems.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, that's actually exactly the kind of thing I was looking to hear. The entire point of it was to give a Prime mage things to fiddle with","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3642-lareath","name":"Lareath","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"186"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}